'''''Pimpinella peregrina''''' is a species of biennial herb in the family [[Apiaceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form and simple, broad leaves. Individuals can grow to 0.72 m.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Pimpinella peregrina L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/5045168|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Pimpinella peregrina (Southern Burnet Saxifrage) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/APIA/Pimpinella_peregrina.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

